    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play Time</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's entirely up to you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How to Play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the one correct option among the choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you pick the correct one, you\u2019ll move on to the next level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make it through 10 levels in a row and\u2026 who knows what might happen?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Controls</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move Cursor: \u2191 \u2193 \u2190 \u2192</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select: Space</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exit / Back: Esc</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Details: Enter</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Guidelines for Streaming and Video Content</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are welcome to stream or upload videos of this game without requesting prior permission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please include the game\u2019s title in your video or stream title, and add a link to this store page in the description.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are not liable for any issues or damages that may arise from playing or streaming the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please note that these guidelines are subject to change without notice.</p>",
